==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Black Slug]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Gory Groom]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Treat this stage like a [[Heavenly Tower]]'s take on [[XP Megablitz]] or [[XP Colosseum]]. Bring the usual [[Bombercat]], [[Pizza Cat]], [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] or [[Dark Lazer]] and you will destroy the stage.

